<title>USA: Flow International names new CFO.</title>
<headline>Flow International names new CFO.</headline>
<dateline>KENT, Wash 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flow International Corp said Stephen Reichenbach was named as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Reichenbach has served as Flow's Interim Chief Financial Officer for the past four months.</p>
<p>Company officials were not immediately available for comment.</p>
</text>
